  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A mass is released from the top of a smooth ramp of height <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"h\"></span>. After leaving the ramp, the mass slides on a rough horizontal surface.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>The mass comes to rest in a distance d. What is the coefficient of dynamic friction between the mass and the horizontal surface?</p>\n<p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"A.  \\frac{gd}{h}\"></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"B.  \\sqrt{\\frac{d}{2gh}}\"></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"C.  \\frac{d}{h}\"></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"D.  \\frac{h}{d}\"></span></p>\n<p>[1]</p><ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\">Option A is shown in the figure above.</li><li data-label=\"B\">Option B is shown in the figure above.</li><li data-label=\"C\">Option C is shown in the figure above.</li><li data-label=\"D\">Option D is shown in the figure above.</li></ol>"
